The genera ''[[Tetrastrum]]'' and ''[[Planctonema]]'' are ''[[incertae sedis]]'' taxa: they are sister to the rest of Oocystaceae and may be classified as such, but do not show the characteristic ultrastructure of Oocystaceae.<ref name=Stenclova2017/>

